---
import CompliantLayout from '@/layouts/CompliantLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '@/components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<CompliantLayout title="Disclosure">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Transparency" title="Disclosure" description="How ChairWise is funded and what the links on this site are." />

  <section class="max-w-site mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-14">
    <article class="content-panel max-w-prose mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-ink">
      <p class="!mt-0">
        We don&rsquo;t use affiliate links. Some links go to products made by the
        same team &mdash; they&rsquo;re labeled.
      </p>
      <p>
        When a page shows a box labeled &ldquo;From our team,&rdquo; it points to a product or
        service built by the people behind ChairWise. We make those products, so we
        benefit if you use them. Those boxes never change which chairs, desks or
        accessories we recommend, and we don&rsquo;t take payment from the brands we cover.
      </p>
      <p>
        Product links in our articles are not tracked, commissioned referral links.
        If you have questions about any recommendation, reach out:
        <a href="mailto:hello@chairwise.app">hello@chairwise.app</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</CompliantLayout>
